language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit SimulatorUiDomain.
capability SimulatorInteraction.
functionality ProjectSimulatorDomain.
functionality RouteSimulatorIntent.
functionality DisplaySimulatorStatus.

SimulatorUI contains SimulatorUiDomain.
SimulatorUiDomain provides SimulatorInteraction.
SimulatorUiDomain status proposed.
SimulatorUiDomain cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/UIDomain/DetailedDesignDiscussion.md".
SimulatorUiDomain owns ProjectSimulatorDomain.
ProjectSimulatorDomain realizes SimulatorInteraction.
ProjectSimulatorDomain specifies "Use separate simulator-control/diagnostic contract; clearly distinguish hidden truth from P1000-visible/emitted data.".
SimulatorUiDomain owns RouteSimulatorIntent.
RouteSimulatorIntent realizes SimulatorInteraction.
RouteSimulatorIntent specifies "Preserve commandId through ambiguous POST/retry/GET lookup; explicit result states without optimistic simulator-state mutation.".
SimulatorUiDomain owns DisplaySimulatorStatus.
DisplaySimulatorStatus realizes SimulatorInteraction.
DisplaySimulatorStatus specifies "Per-consumer cadence, stable plot identities and session/error feedback through shared UI primitives.".
